      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This would be AMAZING! Especially if it made it so regardless of what Group page was looked at that the Instances listed would show the shared Instance. \n\nSucks so much that only one Group can own the Instance and if you're a community member of the Group that doesn't own it you can't see it in the Group Instances, and you have to rely on your Group doing an excellent job of advertising the other Group's Instance.",
